{"channelId":"UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg","row":["Equine.physiotherapy",3,"Unlock tension in your horse's body with a blend of physiotherapy, fascial maneouvres and intention. \nWelcome to my channel where I will show you my approach to equine bodywork. These videos are based on my own experience combined with Human Garage inspired fascial maneouvres. Through using these techniques I have been able to release tension, increase range of motion and support the horse's well-being. \n\nIn each video, I'll show the techniques that meld hands-on physiotherapy, fascia-focused movement and intentional awareness -- designed to reconnect flow and balance with ease. \n\nSubscribe to see more videos, tips and insights into equine holistic care.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:16.880Z","channelId":"UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b87625ff76c59cfe618b9e2ff1899249f4b3aa0c63b2160fda9e3c63868f2e52","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"53930076cd86f7a26be204cbb86e843f014ce9ca2e0508d02a1e32a894e03c45"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3,"raw":"3 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:16.880Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp1-Ys9H3UpepGC69mzMnPg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"Unloc